## Generation Guardrails

- Create small, PR-sized diffs
- Never invent or hardcode secrets (use environment variables)
- Always add tests with code changes
- Follow existing patterns in the codebase
- Ask for clarification when requirements are unclear
- Stop and confirm before major architectural changes
- Respect website terms of service and robots.txt files

## Communication

**How to ask for clarification:**
- Check existing documentation first (@docs/)
- Review similar implementations in codebase
- Ask specific questions about requirements

**When to stop and seek confirmation:**
- Breaking changes to public APIs
- Changes to data models or file formats
- New external dependencies
- Security-related changes
- Performance-critical modifications

**How to report blockers or concerns:**
- Document in code comments
- Create TODO comments with context
- Reference related issues or discussions
